---
import Base from '@layouts/Base.astro';
import { offers, cta, contact } from '@config/site';
---
<Base title="Competitive Decision Sprint" description="A focused competitive intelligence engagement that combines verified market evidence with your company context to support a real decision." path="/competitor-brief/">
  <section class="svc-final__hero" data-surface="dark">
    <div class="container-wide svc-final__hero-grid">
      <div><span class="label">COMPETITIVE DECISION SPRINT</span><h1>Turn competitive evidence into a decision.</h1><p>The Decision Sprint is for a live strategic, product, pricing, positioning or sales decision that cannot be answered responsibly from a public-market brief alone.</p><div class="svc-final__actions"><a class="btn btn--lg" href={cta.secondary.href}>Discuss a Competitive Decision <span>→</span></a><a href={cta.sample.href}>Inspect the sample first →</a></div></div>
      <aside><small class="mono">BEST WHEN</small><b>A real decision is live now.</b><p>Public evidence matters, but internal context changes what the evidence means for your company.</p></aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <main class="svc-final">
    <section class="section svc-final__difference"><div class="container-wide svc-final__split"><div><span class="label">WHAT CHANGES</span><h2>This is not “more pages.”</h2><p>The complimentary brief proves what can be established from public competitive evidence. A Decision Sprint adds the context only your team can provide: the live decision, constraints, deal reality, priorities and commercial tradeoffs.</p></div><div class="svc-final__formula"><span>VERIFIED MARKET EVIDENCE</span><i>+</i><span>CLIENT CONTEXT</span><i>→</i><strong>DECISION</strong></div></div></section>

    <section class="section svc-final__scope"><div class="container-wide"><header><span class="label">CORE SCOPE</span><h2>Built around the decision, not a fixed report template.</h2></header><div class="svc-final__cards"><article><b>01</b><h3>Decision intake</h3><p>The actual question, constraints, timing and known competitive pressure enter the work.</p></article><article><b>02</b><h3>Priority validation</h3><p>We test which competitors and evidence are genuinely decision-critical for your company.</p></article><article><b>03</b><h3>Deeper analysis</h3><p>Pricing, product, positioning and claims are interpreted against your context, not in isolation.</p></article><article><b>04</b><h3>Implications</h3><p>The analysis states what the evidence changes, where risk sits and what deserves attention.</p></article><article><b>05</b><h3>Recommendations</h3><p>Actions are prioritized with uncertainty and evidence boundaries still visible.</p></article><article><b>06</b><h3>Executive package</h3><p>Executive Decision Deck + Evidence Appendix + one revision round.</p></article></div></div></section>

    <section class="section svc-final__standard" data-surface="dark"><div class="container-wide svc-final__split"><div><span class="label">THE EVIDENCE STANDARD</span><h2>Context can change the decision. It cannot rewrite the evidence.</h2><p>Material factual claims stay source-backed and human-reviewed. Fact, Inference and Unknown remain separated. Contradictions remain visible.</p><a href="/method/">See the Evidence Axis method →</a></div><aside class="svc-final__commercial"><small class="mono">ENGAGEMENT</small><strong>{offers.decisionSprint.priceDisplay}</strong><p>{offers.decisionSprint.priceNote}.</p><small class="mono">DELIVERY</small><b>{offers.decisionSprint.delivery}</b></aside></div></section>

    <section class="section svc-final__cta"><div class="container svc-final__cta-inner"><span class="label">START WITH THE DECISION</span><h2>Send the context that changes what “better” means.</h2><p>Scope, delivery and price are confirmed in writing before paid work begins.</p><a class="btn btn--lg" href={cta.secondary.href}>Discuss a Competitive Decision <span>→</span></a><a class="svc-final__email" href={`mailto:${contact.emailDisplay}`}>{contact.emailDisplay}</a></div></section>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
.svc-final{background:#f8f5ef}.svc-final__hero{background:#030914;color:#f4f8ff;padding:clamp(2.8rem,5vw,4.8rem) 0}.svc-final__hero-grid,.svc-final__split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:clamp(2rem,6vw,5rem);align-items:center}.svc-final__hero h1,.svc-final h2{margin:.55rem 0 .8rem;font-size:clamp(2.7rem,5vw,5.2rem);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-.052em}.svc-final__hero p{max-width:52rem;color:#b8c8db;line-height:1.65;font-size:1.04rem}.svc-final__hero aside{padding:1.2rem;border:1px solid rgba(111,160,219,.18);border-radius:.85rem;background:rgba(255,255,255,.025)}.svc-final__hero aside small{color:#64e2da;font-size:.56rem;letter-spacing:.1em}.svc-final__hero aside b{display:block;margin:.45rem 0;font-size:1.25rem}.svc-final__hero aside p{font-size:.86rem;margin:0;color:#8fa5bf}.svc-final__actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.8rem;align-items:center;margin-top:1.3rem}.svc-final__actions>a:not(.btn),.svc-final__standard a{color:#8fdedb;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;text-decoration:none}.svc-final__difference{background:#fff}.svc-final__difference p,.svc-final__scope p,.svc-final__cta p{color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.65}.svc-final__formula{display:grid;gap:.65rem;padding:1.2rem;border:1px solid rgba(31,58,87,.12);border-radius:.85rem;background:#f6f8fa;font:800 .72rem/1.3 var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.07em}.svc-final__formula i{font-style:normal;color:#75869a}.svc-final__formula strong{color:#217f94}.svc-final__scope{background:#f3eee6}.svc-final__scope header{max-width:64rem}.svc-final__cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:.7rem;margin-top:1.3rem}.svc-final__cards article{padding:1rem;border:1px solid rgba(31,58,87,.12);border-radius:.75rem;background:#fff}.svc-final__cards b{font:800 .56rem/1 var(--font-mono);color:#27839a}.svc-final__cards h3{margin:.5rem 0 .3rem}.svc-final__cards p{margin:0;font-size:.84rem;line-height:1.5}.svc-final__standard{background:#030914;color:#f4f8ff}.svc-final__standard p{color:#9fb2c9;line-height:1.65}.svc-final__commercial{padding:1.2rem;border:1px solid rgba(115,164,219,.17);border-radius:.85rem;background:rgba(255,255,255,.025);display:grid;gap:.35rem}.svc-final__commercial small{color:#7f95b0;font-size:.56rem;letter-spacing:.1em;margin-top:.5rem}.svc-final__commercial strong{font-size:1.55rem}.svc-final__commercial p{margin:0;font-size:.85rem}.svc-final__cta{background:#fff}.svc-final__cta-inner{max-width:64rem;text-align:center}.svc-final__cta-inner p{max-width:45rem;margin:.8rem auto 1.1rem}.svc-final__email{display:block;margin-top:1rem;color:#2b7188;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;text-decoration:none}@media(max-width:860px){.svc-final__hero-grid,.svc-final__split{grid-template-columns:1fr}.svc-final__cards{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}@media(max-width:560px){.svc-final__cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}.svc-final__actions{display:grid}.svc-final__actions a{width:100%}}
</style>
